    "body": "SongCore ABI v1 frozen.\nMinimal FFmpeg-backed local audio decode core.\nStatic artifact is the primary supported consumption path.\n\n- target: linux-x86_64 (host-native toolchain)\n- artifact: lib/libsongcore.a — 4,066,924 bytes, 280 members\n  sha256 6b4cf24300f1ebaf2c2aee8ac24aac70195107864af8d40603af4cc32532fef3\n- package tarball sha256: 018e0cbdfd8d83b6967bbba8e899ae6dbcc2ccf690c5294bd48e2ef2699f6815\n- ABI: v1 (15 symbols; layout machine-audited against the frozen snapshot)\n- shared secondary: lib/shared/libsongcore.so (exports exactly the 15 ABI symbols)\n- FFmpeg provenance: n9.0.1 (commit bf1b838f), machine-derived closure profile\n  codec-base; effective license LGPL-2.1-or-later (gpl/version3/nonfree all off,\n  no external lib* components); FFmpeg license texts + relink obligations in LICENSES/\n- reproducibility: byte-identical across forced rebuilds\n- known limitations: local files only; no SRC/mixer/DSP/output backend; lossy seek\n  is landing-explicit, not sample-exact; mid-stream rate/layout change fails closed"
